-9&amp;rft_id=info%3Ahdl%2F10400.1%2F20204&amp;rft.aulast=Barham&amp;rft.aufirst=L.&amp;rft.au=Duller%2C+G.A.T.&amp;rft.au=Candy%2C+I.&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov%2Fpmc%2Farticles%2FPMC10550827&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ATimeline+of+historic+inventions" class="Z3988" about="#mwt64" id="mwF5w"></span></span></li>
