est+Shoes&amp;rft.pub=University+of+Oregon&amp;rft.aulast=Connolly&amp;rft.aufirst=Tom&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fpages.uoregon.edu%2Fconnolly%2FFRsandals.htm&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ATimeline+of+historic+inventions" class="Z3988" about="#mwt203" id="mwGko"></span></span></li>
