I">"Pavlov VI: an Upper Palaeolithic living unit"</a></span>. <i id="mwGuM">Antiquity</i>. <b id="mwGuQ">83</b> (320): <span class="nowrap" id="mwGuU">282–</span>295. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doi_(identifier)" title="Doi (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwGuY">doi</a>:<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://doi.org/10.1017%2FS0003598X00098434" class="external text" id="mwGuc">10.1017/S0003598X00098434</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S2CID_(identifier)" title="S2CID (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwGug">S2CID</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwGuk"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://api.semanticscholar.org/CorpusID:56326310" class="external text" id="mwGuo">56326310</a><span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwGus">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwGuw">26 March</span> 2018</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Antiquity&amp;rft.atitle=Pavlov+VI%3A+an+Upper+Palaeolithic+living+unit&amp;rft.volume=83&amp;rft.issue=320&amp;rft.pages=282-295&amp;rft.date=2009&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1017%2FS0003598X00098434&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.semanticscholar.org%2FCorpusID%3A56326310%23id-name%3DS2CID&amp;rft.aulast=Svoboda&amp;rft.aufirst=Ji%C5%99%C3%AD&amp;rft.au=Kr%C3%A1l%C3%ADk%2C+Miroslav&amp;rft.au=%C4%8Cul%C3%ADkov%C3%A1%2C+V%C4%9Bra&amp;rft.au=Hladilov%C3%A1%2C+%C5%A0%C3%A1rka&amp;rft.au=Nov%C3%A1k%2C+Martin&amp;rft.au=N%C3%BDvltov%C3%A1Fi%C5%A1%C3%A1kov%C3%A1%2C+Miriam&amp;rft.au=N%C3%BDvlt%2C+Daniel&amp;rft.au=Zelinkov%C3%A1%2C+Michaela&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.academia.edu%2F875886&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ATimeline+of+historic+inventions" class="Z3988" about="#mwt242" id="mwGu0"></span></span></li>
