<li about="#cite_note-262" id="cite_note-262" data-mw-footnote-number="256"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwIvA"><a href="#cite_ref-262" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwIvE"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwIvI">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-262" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt806" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwIvM" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Cite web ","href":"./Template:Cite_web"},"params":{"url":{"wt":"https://m.rbi.org.in/Scripts/PublicationsView.aspx?id=155"},"title":{"wt":"Reserve Bank of India - Publications"},"quote":{"wt":"In ancient India, loan deed forms called rnapatra or rnalekhya were in use. These contained details such as the name of the debtor and the creditor, the amount of loan, the rate of interest, the condition of repayment and the time of repayment. The deed was witnessed by a person of respectable means and endorsed by the loan-deed writer. Execution of loan deeds continued during the Buddhist period, when they were called inapanna."}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt806" id="mwIvQ"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://m.rbi.org.in/Scripts/PublicationsView.aspx?id=155" class="external text" id="mwIvU">"Reserve Bank of India - Publications"</a>. <q id="mwIvY">In ancient India, loan deed forms called rnapatra or rnalekhya were in use. These contained details such as the name of the debtor and the creditor, the amount of loan, the rate of interest, the condition of repayment and the time of repayment. The deed was witnessed by a person of respectable means and endorsed by the loan-deed writer. Execution of loan deeds continued during the Buddhist period, when they were called inapanna.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Reserve+Bank+of+India+-+Publications&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fm.rbi.org.in%2FScripts%2FPublicationsView.aspx%3Fid%3D155&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ATimeline+of+historic+inventions" class="Z3988" about="#mwt806" id="mwIvc"></span></span></li>
