"mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7255306" class="external text" id="mwLD8">7255306</a></span>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PMID_(identifier)" title="PMID (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwLEA">PMID</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLEE"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/32450110" class="external text" id="mwLEI">32450110</a>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Lancet&amp;rft.atitle=A+history+of+the+medical+mask+and+the+rise+of+throwaway+culture&amp;rft.volume=396&amp;rft.issue=10243&amp;rft.pages=19-20&amp;rft.date=2020-07&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov%2Fpmc%2Farticles%2FPMC7255306%23id-name%3DPMC&amp;rft_id=info%3Apmid%2F32450110&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1016%2FS0140-6736%2820%2931207-1&amp;rft.aulast=Strasser&amp;rft.aufirst=BJ&amp;rft.au=Schlich%2C+T&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov%2Fpmc%2Farticles%2FPMC7255306&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ATimeline+of+historic+inventions" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1495" id="mwLEM"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-528" id="cite_note-528" data-mw-footnote-number="521"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLEQ"><a href="#cite_ref-528" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLEU"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLEY">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-528" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1498" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLEc" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite journal","href":"./Template:Cite_journal"},"params":{"author":{"wt":"von Pechmann, H."},"year":{"wt":"1898"},"url":{"wt":"http://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k90751n/f312.image.langEN"},"title":{"wt":"Ueber Diazomethan und Nitrosoacylamine"},"journal":{"wt":"Berichte der Deutschen Chemischen Gesellschaft zu Berlin"},"volume":{"wt":"31"},"issue":{"wt":"3"},"pages":{"wt":"2640–2646"},"quote":{"wt":"page 643: Erwähnt sei noch, dass aus einer ätherischen Diazomethanlösung sich beim Stehen manchmal minimale Quantitäten eines weissen, flockigen, aus Chloroform krystallisirenden Körpers abscheiden;&amp;nbsp;... (It should be mentioned that from an ether solution of diazomethane, upon standing, sometimes small quantities of a white, flakey substance, which can be crystallized from chloroform, precipitate;&amp;nbsp;... )"},"doi":{"wt":"10.1002/cber.18980310314"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFvon_Pechmann,_H.1898" class="citation journal cs1" about="#mwt1498">von Pechmann, H. (1898). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="http://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k90751n/f312.image.langEN" class="external text" id="mwLEg">"Ueber Diazomethan und Nitrosoacylamine"</a>. <i id="mwLEk">Berichte der Deutschen Chemischen Gesellschaft zu Berlin</i>. <b id="mwLEo">31</b> (3): <span class="nowrap" id="mwLEs">2640–</span>2646. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doi_(identifier)" title="Doi (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwLEw">doi</a>:<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://doi.org/10.1002%2Fcber.18980310314" class="external text" id="mwLE0">10.1002/cber.18980310314</a>. <q id="mwLE4">page 643: Erwähnt sei noch, dass aus einer ätherischen Diazomethanlösung sich beim Stehen manchmal minimale Quantitäten eines weissen, flockigen, aus Chloroform krystallisirenden Körpers abscheiden;<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLE8"> </span>... (It should be mentioned that from an ether solution of diazomethane, upon standing, sometimes small quantities of a white, flakey substance, which can be crystallized from chloroform, precipitate;<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLFA"> </span>... )</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Berichte+der+Deutschen+Chemischen+Gesellschaft+zu+Berlin&amp;rft.atitle=Ueber+Diazomethan+und+Nitrosoacylamine&amp;rft.volume=31&amp;rft.issue=3&amp;rft.pages=2640-2646&amp;rft.date=1898&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1002%2Fcber.18980310314&amp;rft.au=von+Pechmann%2C+H.&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fgallica.bnf.fr%2Fark%3A%2F12148%2Fbpt6k90751n%2Ff312.image.langEN&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ATimeline+of+historic+inventions" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1498" id="mwLFE"></span></span></li>
